          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.086,
            0.881,
            0.126
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** If the rope is folded 10 times and cut, we get 10 + 2 = 12 pieces. In the same way, when the rope is folded r times and cut, we get r + 2 pieces."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.153,
            0.252,
            0.171
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Page No. 104"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.186,
            0.883,
            0.244
          ],
          "content": "**12.Look at the matchstick pattern below. Observe and identify the pattern. How many matchsticks are required to make 10 such squares? How many are required to make w squares?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.193,
            0.253,
            0.293,
            0.322
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
