          "image_source": "images/page_37_image_5.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.351,
            0.456,
            0.369
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** To make 10 squares, we need"
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "bbox": [
            0.374,
            0.373,
            0.623,
            0.391
          ],
          "content": "4 + 3 \\times 9 = 31   matchrisks",
          "image_source": "images/page_37_equation_7.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.419,
            0.847,
            0.438
          ],
          "content": "To make w squares the number of matchsticks required is = 4 + 3 (w - 1)"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
            0.465,
            0.883,
            0.55
          ],
          "content": "**13.Have you noticed how the colours change in a traffic signal? The sequence of colour changes is shown below. Find the colour at positions 90, 190, and 343. Write expressions to describe the positions for each colour.**"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.304,
            0.556,
            0.625,
            0.618
          ],
          "content": "",
          "captions": [],
          "footnotes": [],
          "image_source": "images/page_37_image_10.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.635,
            0.37,
            0.665
          ],
          "content": "Ans: For Position $\\mathbf { 9 0 } ; { \\frac { \\mathbf { 9 0 } } { 4 } }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.668,
            0.382,
            0.686
          ],
          "content": "The colour is Yellow."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.699,
            0.389,
            0.73
          ],
          "content": "**For Position 190**: $\\frac { \\mathbf { 1 9 0 } } { 4 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.73,
            0.379,
            0.747
          ],
          "content": "The colour is Yellow"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.761,
            0.388,
            0.792
          ],
          "content": "**For Position 343**: $\\frac { 3 4 3 } { 4 }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.793,
            0.373,
            0.81
          ],
          "content": "The colour is Green"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.826,
            0.254,
            0.844
          ],
          "content": "**Expressions**:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.172,
            0.845,
            0.852,
            0.885
          ],
          "content": "In general, 4n – 3 positions for red light, 4n – 1 position for green light and 2n position for yellow light."
        },
